{"data":{"body":"[P2] Allow opener functions to return concrete scope types. Because generic arguments are invariant, this bound rejects a valid `Function<MyPlugin, MyScope>` when `MyScope implements AutoCloseable`, forcing integrations to declare the less-specific `AutoCloseable` return type. Use `? extends AutoCloseable` and add a compile-time test with a concrete scope class.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc768vSX","finding_digest":"3751d2007a1fd50f372f8a3b82d2278c31446d5f17b0c4dc0379a57883ee15ef","finding_id":"arf_v1_g5i5ead2d7kq6nzpri5yfurhrq","finding_key":"sdk/plugin/handler-scoped::value::closeable-return-invariance","identity_key":"sdk/plugin/handler-scoped::value::closeable-return-invariance","line":29,"observation_digest":"3ade9be821970047e60b7c5a21c3d4063f203b697d1a602e53a826ea59d821ea","observation_id":"aro_v1_hlpjx2bbs4aepzqlprncdq6uay","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/HandlerScoped.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-07T17:59:37Z","review_id":"arr_v1_tmlxlrigu66tynz3g3iwivdxay","reviewed_base_sha":"a521da02a2586439f6d200f7b1b0b98368d737df","reviewed_head_sha":"89d96c322c82fdf4aa73291e4c98b6a9d0fdadaa","reviewer":"codex","start_line":29,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_snxgtusxfolre2nzco7x5fk234"},"pull_request":{"number":782},"record_id":"art_v1_pttusr2wmv5n3peii7thkuz7ep","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-07T17:59:37Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
